      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/RCMPNL/status/2018326849592443238",
      "text": "⚠️TRAFFIC ADVISORY: Whitbourne RCMP urges motorists to use extreme caution while travelling in the area. Police are receiving reports from motorists experiencing very poor visibility due to whiteout conditions. Many drivers are finding themselves stuck in the snow – particularly on the on and off-ramps from the Trans-Canada Highway, which are snow-covered and slippery.\n\nPlease delay any non-essential travel until road and weather conditions improve. If you must travel, slow down and use extreme caution. Avoid sudden braking and ensure your lights are on so others can see you. \n\n#nltraffic",
