      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY (Fort Sanders) - KUB crews have implemented the following road closures for water system repairs:\n\n- 12th Street between Forest Avenue and Highland Avenue\n- Highland Avenue between 11th Street and 13th Street\n\nCrews have valved off the damaged water main, which will allow surface water migrating towards World's Fair Park Drive to recede. Repairs are expected to continue through Tuesday, February 3, in this area. Flaggers and other traffic control measures are in place to assist with traffic flow in the area. Updates will be posted as conditions warrant.",
